    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0e09fb3a9cf7e0c711ed",
      "document_start": 692,
      "document_end": 871,
      "text": "Because we have material entering and leaving the CV, we can imagine that this material can enter or leave with a different pressure and density as it interacts with our fixed CV.",
      "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d916d7b58af36d71f2e4",
      "document_start": 872,
      "document_end": 947,
      "text": "Because of this, we must account for the energy used to make these changes.",
      "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_55e35f088690e37c93f1",
      "document_start": 948,
      "document_end": 1118,
      "text": "Alternatively, one can envision the material coming in at a higher pressure or density and wanting to push our imaginary CV outward, but since we fixed our CV, it cannot.",
      "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_29d2163078c9972d3037",
      "document_start": 1119,
      "document_end": 1204,
      "text": "The energy from this must go somewhere so it works on the fluid in and around our CV.",
      "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_033a2536ff8fa3b85060",
      "document_start": 1205,
      "document_end": 1302,
      "text": "Mathematically, this results in the energy term in Equation 2.44 having to include a  $pv$  term.",
      "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2054873bc6707cd3985c",
      "document_start": 1303,
      "document_end": 1345,
      "text": "This is sometimes known as flow work [10].",
      "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_cf52a21332b5353256d6",
      "document_start": 1346,
      "document_end": 1396,
      "text": "With this in mind, Equation 2.44 can be written as",
      "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b"
    },
    {
