    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_878fae263a00dbd7213e",
      "document_start": 1473,
      "document_end": 1601,
      "text": "Here, by multiplying the intensive properties by the mass flow rate  $\\dot{m}$ , we have the rate of change of the energy terms.",
      "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6aeceb639855710798ad",
      "document_start": 1602,
      "document_end": 1660,
      "text": "We have also arbitrarily assumed one inlet and one outlet.",
