          "sentence_id": "sentence_b3d1b7337943b7d4cd13",
          "document_start": 407,
          "document_end": 509,
          "text": "The reader is advised to consult any thermodynamics text for a better understanding of the difference.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 407,
          "end": 509,
          "chunk_start": 407,
          "chunk_end": 509,
          "sentence_document_start": 407,
          "sentence_document_end": 509,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_dee6610c78f65e882e8c",
          "document_start": 511,
          "document_end": 531,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 511,
          "end": 531,
          "chunk_start": 511,
          "chunk_end": 531,
          "sentence_document_start": 511,
          "sentence_document_end": 531,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_911904a28fb53729d806",
          "document_start": 532,
          "document_end": 551,
          "text": "2.4 Thermodynamics;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 532,
          "end": 551,
          "chunk_start": 532,
          "chunk_end": 551,
          "sentence_document_start": 532,
          "sentence_document_end": 551,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2dbe387a279ddb8d2ee3",
          "document_start": 552,
          "document_end": 584,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 552,
          "end": 584,
          "chunk_start": 552,
          "chunk_end": 584,
          "sentence_document_start": 552,
          "sentence_document_end": 584,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_815cbbdaf24881065194",
          "document_start": 586,
          "document_end": 691,
          "text": "The substitutions that were performed to arrive at Equation 2.41 are not as straightforward in this case.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 586,
          "end": 691,
          "chunk_start": 586,
          "chunk_end": 691,
          "sentence_document_start": 586,
          "sentence_document_end": 691,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0e09fb3a9cf7e0c711ed",
          "document_start": 692,
          "document_end": 871,
          "text": "Because we have material entering and leaving the CV, we can imagine that this material can enter or leave with a different pressure and density as it interacts with our fixed CV.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 692,
          "end": 871,
          "chunk_start": 692,
          "chunk_end": 871,
          "sentence_document_start": 692,
          "sentence_document_end": 871,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_d916d7b58af36d71f2e4",
          "document_start": 872,
          "document_end": 947,
          "text": "Because of this, we must account for the energy used to make these changes.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 872,
          "end": 947,
          "chunk_start": 872,
          "chunk_end": 947,
          "sentence_document_start": 872,
          "sentence_document_end": 947,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_55e35f088690e37c93f1",
          "document_start": 948,
          "document_end": 1118,
          "text": "Alternatively, one can envision the material coming in at a higher pressure or density and wanting to push our imaginary CV outward, but since we fixed our CV, it cannot.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 948,
          "end": 1118,
          "chunk_start": 948,
          "chunk_end": 1118,
          "sentence_document_start": 948,
          "sentence_document_end": 1118,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_29d2163078c9972d3037",
          "document_start": 1119,
          "document_end": 1204,
          "text": "The energy from this must go somewhere so it works on the fluid in and around our CV.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1119,
          "end": 1204,
          "chunk_start": 1119,
          "chunk_end": 1204,
          "sentence_document_start": 1119,
          "sentence_document_end": 1204,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_033a2536ff8fa3b85060",
          "document_start": 1205,
          "document_end": 1302,
          "text": "Mathematically, this results in the energy term in Equation 2.44 having to include a  $pv$  term.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1205,
          "end": 1302,
          "chunk_start": 1205,
          "chunk_end": 1302,
          "sentence_document_start": 1205,
          "sentence_document_end": 1302,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2054873bc6707cd3985c",
          "document_start": 1303,
          "document_end": 1345,
          "text": "This is sometimes known as flow work [10].",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1303,
          "end": 1345,
          "chunk_start": 1303,
          "chunk_end": 1345,
          "sentence_document_start": 1303,
          "sentence_document_end": 1345,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_cf52a21332b5353256d6",
          "document_start": 1346,
          "document_end": 1396,
          "text": "With this in mind, Equation 2.44 can be written as",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1346,
          "end": 1396,
          "chunk_start": 1346,
          "chunk_end": 1396,
          "sentence_document_start": 1346,
          "sentence_document_end": 1396,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_edbf7cdd09fc504c50e9",
          "document_start": 1398,
          "document_end": 1418,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1398,
          "end": 1418,
          "chunk_start": 1398,
          "chunk_end": 1418,
          "sentence_document_start": 1398,
          "sentence_document_end": 1418,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ca76b2e4cb78b8ece0ce",
          "document_start": 1419,
          "document_end": 1438,
          "text": "2.4 Thermodynamics;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1419,
          "end": 1438,
          "chunk_start": 1419,
          "chunk_end": 1438,
          "sentence_document_start": 1419,
          "sentence_document_end": 1438,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_04aef6add8e035771d1f",
          "document_start": 1439,
          "document_end": 1471,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1439,
          "end": 1471,
          "chunk_start": 1439,
          "chunk_end": 1471,
          "sentence_document_start": 1439,
          "sentence_document_end": 1471,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_878fae263a00dbd7213e",
          "document_start": 1473,
          "document_end": 1601,
          "text": "Here, by multiplying the intensive properties by the mass flow rate  $\\dot{m}$ , we have the rate of change of the energy terms.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1473,
          "end": 1601,
          "chunk_start": 1473,
          "chunk_end": 1601,
          "sentence_document_start": 1473,
          "sentence_document_end": 1601,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6aeceb639855710798ad",
          "document_start": 1602,
          "document_end": 1660,
          "text": "We have also arbitrarily assumed one inlet and one outlet.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1602,
          "end": 1660,
          "chunk_start": 1602,
          "chunk_end": 1660,
          "sentence_document_start": 1602,
          "sentence_document_end": 1660,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_4d6f65dae5587d1cecad",
          "document_start": 1661,
          "document_end": 1859,
          "text": "If more inlets or outlets in our CV were present and they had different mass flow rates or pressures, we would have to consider each with a term identical to our outlet or inlet terms given earlier.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1661,
          "end": 1859,
          "chunk_start": 1661,
          "chunk_end": 1859,
          "sentence_document_start": 1661,
          "sentence_document_end": 1859,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1d7aaddfa530a6692c4e",
          "document_start": 1860,
          "document_end": 1922,
          "text": "We now can make the substitution for our energy terms to yield",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1860,
          "end": 1922,
          "chunk_start": 1860,
          "chunk_end": 1922,
          "sentence_document_start": 1860,
          "sentence_document_end": 1922,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_c68a2cf2d2ae086e31eb",
          "document_start": 1924,
          "document_end": 1944,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1924,
          "end": 1944,
          "chunk_start": 1924,
          "chunk_end": 1944,
          "sentence_document_start": 1924,
          "sentence_document_end": 1944,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_dcdc1f2f315eb9dd7411",
          "document_start": 1945,
          "document_end": 1964,
          "text": "2.4 Thermodynamics;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1945,
          "end": 1964,
          "chunk_start": 1945,
          "chunk_end": 1964,
          "sentence_document_start": 1945,
          "sentence_document_end": 1964,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_70489fce7a32b2361210",
          "document_start": 1965,
          "document_end": 1997,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1965,
          "end": 1997,
          "chunk_start": 1965,
          "chunk_end": 1997,
          "sentence_document_start": 1965,
          "sentence_document_end": 1997,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a0ee67471f1a9356a2d8",
          "document_start": 1999,
          "document_end": 2081,
          "text": "In this case, we have also assumed a uniform velocity over the inlets and outlets.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 1999,
          "end": 2081,
          "chunk_start": 1999,
          "chunk_end": 2081,
          "sentence_document_start": 1999,
          "sentence_document_end": 2081,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_35d37ddc113200d223cb",
          "document_start": 2082,
          "document_end": 2187,
          "text": "With one inlet and outlet, the mass flow in must equal the mass flow out so we can write Equation 2.46 as",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2082,
          "end": 2187,
          "chunk_start": 2082,
          "chunk_end": 2187,
          "sentence_document_start": 2082,
          "sentence_document_end": 2187,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_83990d5e8438163785e0",
          "document_start": 2189,
          "document_end": 2209,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2189,
          "end": 2209,
          "chunk_start": 2189,
          "chunk_end": 2209,
          "sentence_document_start": 2189,
          "sentence_document_end": 2209,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9693b27e29f662a19f21",
          "document_start": 2210,
          "document_end": 2229,
          "text": "2.4 Thermodynamics;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2210,
          "end": 2229,
          "chunk_start": 2210,
          "chunk_end": 2229,
          "sentence_document_start": 2210,
          "sentence_document_end": 2229,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_c4dd0e44ecaa8c57f523",
          "document_start": 2230,
          "document_end": 2262,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2230,
          "end": 2262,
          "chunk_start": 2230,
          "chunk_end": 2262,
          "sentence_document_start": 2230,
          "sentence_document_end": 2262,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_da85f10ba0f13dc19254",
          "document_start": 2264,
          "document_end": 2342,
          "text": "As a review, we have two equations that state the first law of thermodynamics.",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2264,
          "end": 2342,
          "chunk_start": 2264,
          "chunk_end": 2342,
          "sentence_document_start": 2264,
          "sentence_document_end": 2342,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1c783fc82a501dcc3065",
          "document_start": 2343,
          "document_end": 2399,
          "text": "For a fixed mass of material (Lagrangian frame), we have",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2343,
          "end": 2399,
          "chunk_start": 2343,
          "chunk_end": 2399,
          "sentence_document_start": 2343,
          "sentence_document_end": 2399,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ae4e6726f6fdaa626d1f",
          "document_start": 2401,
          "document_end": 2421,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2401,
          "end": 2421,
          "chunk_start": 2401,
          "chunk_end": 2421,
          "sentence_document_start": 2401,
          "sentence_document_end": 2421,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0cfa445edc60c34e03b0",
          "document_start": 2422,
          "document_end": 2441,
          "text": "2.4 Thermodynamics;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2422,
          "end": 2441,
          "chunk_start": 2422,
          "chunk_end": 2441,
          "sentence_document_start": 2422,
          "sentence_document_end": 2441,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_868fd018129bbe5dfcb1",
          "document_start": 2442,
          "document_end": 2474,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2442,
          "end": 2474,
          "chunk_start": 2442,
          "chunk_end": 2474,
          "sentence_document_start": 2442,
          "sentence_document_end": 2474,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f62743a38a71613d8c0b",
          "document_start": 2476,
          "document_end": 2561,
          "text": "and for a fixed volume that material can flow in and out of (Eulerian frame), we have",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2476,
          "end": 2561,
          "chunk_start": 2476,
          "chunk_end": 2561,
          "sentence_document_start": 2476,
          "sentence_document_end": 2561,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ea6a0669bf626ca8ef53",
          "document_start": 2563,
          "document_end": 2583,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 7;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
          "start": 2563,
          "end": 2583,
          "chunk_start": 2563,
          "chunk_end": 2583,
          "sentence_document_start": 2563,
          "sentence_document_end": 2583,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5cd0ffa17fcc81a4c746",
          "document_start": 2584,
          "document_end": 2603,
          "text": "2.4 Thermodynamics;",
          "section_id": "section_25a076b80a6b",
